improving our SaaS product\'s performance., and I would value the opportunity to contribute with strong ownership, communication, and execution.</p><p>Sincerely,\\nJohn Doe</p>\", \"name\": \"John Doe\", \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\", \"mobile\": \"+91 98765 43210\", \"skills\": \"Laravel, PHP, MySQL\", \"company\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"job_role\": \"Senior Laravel Developer\", \"location\": \"Bengaluru, India\", \"templateId\": 45, \"template_id\": 45, \"company_name\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"job_description\": \"We are looking for a Senior Laravel Developer to join our team. You will be responsible for building scalable APIs, managing databases, and improving our SaaS product\'s performance.\", \"resume_uploaded\": false}',1,'2026-05-27 17:55:52','2026-05-27 17:55:54'),(9,NULL,41,NULL,'uDATNb7m9cbuwgqNQxWsILyk8mz4payTSbkh1V9V','Senior Laravel Developer','Acme SaaS','{\"body\": \"Dear Hiring Manager,\\n\\nI am writing to express my enthusiastic interest in the Senior Laravel Developer position at Acme SaaS. With a strong background in Laravel, PHP, and MySQL, I am well-prepared to contribute to your team\'s success in building scalable APIs and effectively managing databases.\\n\\nMy experience aligns perfectly with your need for a developer focused on improving SaaS product performance. I am confident in my ability to deliver high-quality, efficient solutions that will enhance your product\'s capabilities.\\n\\nI am eager to bring my expertise to Acme SaaS and contribute to your innovative work. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills can benefit your team.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nJohn Doe\", \"name\": \"John Doe\", \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\", \"mobile\": \"+91 98765 43210\", \"skills\": \"Laravel, PHP, MySQL\", \"company\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"job_role\": \"Senior Laravel Developer\", \"location\": \"Bengaluru, India\", \"company_name\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"resume_uploaded\": false}',0,'2026-06-03 16:27:32','2026-06-03 16:27:32'),(11,26,41,NULL,'3SFA4vJCEzVfBQhEIEzmjRjaPGvnWqfRxQLQr9vr','',NULL,'{\"body\": \"Dear Hiring Manager,\\n\\nI am writing to express my keen interest in a challenging Business Development role where I can leverage my 9+ years of experience in driving growth and achieving strategic objectives. My background spans both Fire Security Products and Telecommunication Services, with a proven track record in Business Development, Sales & Marketing, and Key Account Management.\\n\\nThroughout my career, including my recent tenure as Manager Sales at Idea Cellular Ltd., I have excelled in devising and implementing strategies to ensure top-line and bottom-line attainment, promote products, and achieve business goals. I am adept at creating innovative approaches that drive profitable revenue growth, build strong relationships with key corporate decision-makers, and manage high-performing teams. My expertise includes strategic planning, cross-selling, and ensuring customer delight through high-quality service.\\n\\nI am confident that my proactive approach and comprehensive skill set would make a significant contribution to your organization. I am eager to discuss how my experience aligns with your team\'s needs.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nSANDEEP MISHRA\", \"name\": \"SANDEEP MISHRA\", \"email\": \"smimm1940@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"+91 7090536393\", \"skills\": \"\", \"company\": \"\", \"job_role\": \"\", \"location\": \"Key Accounts handled:Sun Edison, Zyme Solutions, Gerdau Steel, Cross domain, Biocon Ltd, Tesco Hindustan, Target Corporation Ltd, Subex Ltd, Informatica Business Solutions, Volvo India Pvt. Ltd., Apollo, Toyota Financial, CCD, Cross Domain, Curam software\", \"company_name\": \"\", \"resume_uploaded\": true}',0,'2026-06-04 17:59:42','2026-06-04 17:59:42'),(12,NULL,41,NULL,'uJQueflwQBLK25h3fL5w0JTso2TEDY1STWYNHtmF','Senior Laravel Developer','Acme SaaS','{\"id\": null, \"body\": \"<p>Dear Hiring Manager,</p><p>I am excited to apply for the Senior Laravel Developer position at Acme SaaS.</p><p>With over 6 years of experience building scalable web applications, RESTful APIs, and cloud-based solutions, I have successfully delivered high-performance products across multiple industries.</p><p>My expertise includes Laravel, React.js, MySQL, AWS, and modern software architecture. I am passionate about building clean, maintainable code and collaborating with cross-functional teams to create exceptional user experiences.</p><p>I would welcome the opportunity to contribute my technical expertise and problem-solving skills to your organization.</p><p>Sincerely,</p><p>James Smith</p>\", \"name\": \"James Smith\", \"email\": \"james.smith@example.com\", \"mobile\": \"+1 (555) 123-4567\", \"skills\": \"Laravel, React.js, MySQL, AWS\", \"company\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"job_role\": \"Senior Laravel Developer\", \"location\": \"Austin, Texas, USA\", \"templateId\": \"41\", \"job_description\": \"We are looking for a Senior Laravel Developer to join our team. You will be responsible for building scalable APIs, managing databases, and improving our SaaS product\'s performance.\", \"resume_uploaded\": false}',0,'2026-06-06 22:20:52','2026-06-06 22:20:52'),(13,NULL,41,NULL,'k6ataNBRVBWRWyTOnazoynFNHaAEAfGr6ykP5R4s','AGM sales','Progressive Techserve','{\"body\": \"Dear Hiring Manager,\\n\\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the Senior Business Development Manager for South India Sales position at Progressive Techserve. With my proven track record as an AGM Sales, I am confident in my ability to drive significant growth and achieve your strategic objectives.\\n\\nMy experience encompasses comprehensive sales strategy development, market penetration, and cultivating robust client relationships across the South Indian region. I consistently exceed sales targets and excel at leading successful business development initiatives.\\n\\nI am eager to leverage my expertise to contribute to Progressive Techserve\'s continued success. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing this exciting opportunity further.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nSIDDHARTHA VERMA\", \"name\": \"SIDDHARTHA VERMA\", \"email\": \"siddharthaverma03@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"8310168475\", \"skills\": \"\", \"company\": \"Progressive Techserve\", \"job_role\": \"AGM sales\", \"location\": \"ICFAI Business School, Pune\", \"company_name\": \"Progressive Techserve\", \"resume_uploaded\": true}',0,'2026-07-30 15:58:24','2026-07-30 16:00:36'),(14,11,42,NULL,'dCtapbohAgpDLmmWPbs8M7cIMdKakrWw7tgwBlnx','Manager Sales','Acme SaaS','{\"body\": \"Dear Hiring Team,\\n\\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Senior Laravel Developer position at Acme SaaS. While my recent experience has been in Sales Management, I bring a robust technical foundation in Java, C/C++, Data Structures, DBMS, and Networking, which aligns with the core requirements of building scalable APIs and managing databases.\\n\\nMy background has equipped me with a deep understanding of software architecture and system optimization, and I am eager to apply my problem-solving skills to enhance your SaaS product\'s performance. I am a rapid and dedicated learner, committed to mastering new technologies like Laravel to contribute effectively to your team.\\n\\nMy unique perspective from client-facing roles in the SaaS industry also provides valuable insight into user needs and product strategy. I am confident that my blend of technical aptitude and strategic understanding makes me a strong candidate for this role.\\n\\nThank you for your time and consideration.\\n\\nSincerely,\\nSANDEEP\", \"name\": \"SANDEEP\", \"email\": \"smimm1940@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"+91 7090536393\", \"skills\": \"Java, Business Development & Management, Sales & Marketing, Key Account Management, Channel Management, Cross Selling, Customer Relationship Management, Territory Management, Market Research, Client Coordination, Strategic Planning, Executive Leadership, Team Management & Training, C, C++, Networking, OS, DS, DBMS, Fox pro\", \"company\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"job_role\": \"Manager Sales\", \"location\": \"Bangalore, Karnataka\", \"company_name\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"resume_uploaded\": false}',0,'2026-08-05 15:37:49','2026-08-05 15:37:49'),(15,20,42,NULL,NULL,'Senior Laravel Developer','Acme SaaS','{\"id\": 15, \"body\": \"<p>Dear Hiring Manager,</p><p>I am writing to express my strong interest in the Senior Laravel Developer position at Acme SaaS. My expertise in Laravel, React.js, MySQL, and AWS directly aligns with your requirements for building scalable APIs, managing databases, and enhancing product performance.</p><p>I am confident I can make immediate contributions to your team and am eager to discuss my qualifications further. Thank you for your time and consideration.</p><p>Sincerely,\\nJames Smith</p>\", \"name\": \"James Smith\", \"email\": \"james.smith@example.com\", \"mobile\": \"+1 (555) 123-4567\", \"skills\": \"Laravel, React.js, MySQL, AWS\", \"company\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"job_role\": \"Senior Laravel Developer\", \"location\": \"Austin, Texas, USA\", \"templateId\": 42, \"template_id\": 42, \"company_name\": \"Acme SaaS\", \"job_description\": \"We are looking for a Senior Laravel Developer to join our team. You will be responsible for building scalable APIs, managing databases, and improving our SaaS product\'s performance.\", \"resume_uploaded\": false}',1,'2026-08-06 21:34:24','2026-08-06 21:34:41'),(16,20,44,NULL,'o0eAev7pSEq4aQvDCwpMfMPnDLA4cRji4qlCZNIW','',NULL,'{\"id\": 16, \"body\": \"Dear Hiring Team,\\n\\nI am writing to express my keen interest in the Senior Laravel Developer position, as advertised. With a strong background in Laravel development, I am confident in my ability to contribute significantly to your team.\\n\\nMy experience aligns perfectly with the responsibilities outlined, including building scalable APIs, efficiently managing databases, and optimizing the performance of SaaS produ