INSERT INTO `resume_analyses` VALUES (1,NULL,'o4yXvQ9BGJAGfPOYZYteQkUEVEMYtZhSRtT84NkJ','General',NULL,'Gautam_Sharma_Resume.pdf','GAUTAM SHARMA \nMERN Stack Developer | Full Stack Engineer \ngautamrajanexpert@gmail.com | +91 6205499691 | Noida, UP, India \nlinkedin.com/in/gautam-sharma-3671162ab | github.com/GautamSharma16 \nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY \nMotivated MERN Stack Developer with hands-on experience building scalable, production-grade full-stack web applications using \nMongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js. Proficient in REST API design, JWT-based authentication, and building responsive React \ndashboards. Adept at working in collaborative team environments with strong command of Git workflows and modern AI-assisted \ndevelopment tools. Passionate about writing clean, high-performance code and delivering measurable impact. \nTECHNICAL SKILLS \nFrontend: React.js, JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap \nBackend: Node.js, Express.js, Spring Boot, Java \nDatabases: MongoDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL \nTools & Technologies: Git, GitHub, REST APIs, JWT Authentication, Postman, VS Code, IntelliJ IDEA \nAI & Modern Dev: Cursor, Claude, Codex, MCP Servers, AI-Assisted Development \nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE \nMERN Stack Developer Intern Feb 2024 – Present \nCompanyvista Inc | On-site | my.companyvista.com \n• Engineered full-stack features across the platform using MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js, contributing to a live \nproduction application with real user traffic. \n• Architected and documented RESTful APIs powering core business workflows, reducing frontend-backend integration time and \nimproving response consistency. \n• Developed interactive React.js dashboards with real-time data rendering, improving data accessibility and boosting user \nengagement across key modules. \n• Optimized MongoDB aggregation pipelines and Express.js middleware, achieving approximately 25–30% improvement in API \nresponse times and overall application throughput. \nPROJECTS \nTrimNet — URL Shortener · React.js · Spring Boot · PostgreSQL | trimnet.vercel.app/ \n• Designed and delivered a full-stack URL shortening system with RESTful APIs supporting link creation, intelligent redirection, and \nper-link usage analytics. \n• Built a responsive, user-friendly React.js frontend with seamless backend integration and robust server-side validation, ensuring \nreliable data handling at scale. \n• Optimized PostgreSQL queries for high-throughput read/write operations and deployed the application to cloud infrastructure for \nconsistent availability. \nAI Research Browser Extension · React.js · Spring Boot · Gemini API | github.com/GautamSharma16/Research-Assistant \n• Developed a browser extension leveraging Google Gemini API to deliver real-time text summarization, context-aware question \ngeneration, and smart topic suggestions. \n• Engineered secure Spring Boot backend APIs handling AI request routing and response optimization, reducing processing latency \nfor a smoother user experience. \n• Crafted an intuitive, productivity-focused UI that streamlined research workflows, enabling users to extract key insights from web \ncontent without switching tabs. \nEDUCATION \nMaster of Computer Applications (MCA) 2024 – Present \nGalgotia College of Engineering and Technology, Greater Noida | CGPA: 7.70 \nBachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) 2021 – 2024 \nGopal Narayan Singh University, Sasaram | CGPA: 7.95 \nCERTIFICATIONS \n• Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 2025 Certified AI Foundation Associate \n• Basics of Android App Development — Masai School (2023)','{\"name\": \"GAUTAM SHARMA\", \"email\": \"gautamrajanexpert@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"+91 6205499691\", \"skills\": [\"Frontend: React.js\", \"JavaScript (ES6+)\", \"HTML5\", \"CSS3\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Backend: Node.js\", \"Express.js\", \"Spring Boot\", \"Java\", \"Databases: MongoDB\", \"MySQL\", \"PostgreSQL\", \"Tools & Technologies: Git\", \"GitHub\", \"REST APIs\", \"JWT Authentication\",