 N. S. Y High School 2018/05 – 2019/04 | Teri, India \n70% \n \nTraining, ITECHDREAMS 19/03/24 – 25/05/2024 | Rohtas, India \n• During my BCA 6th semester industrial training at ITECHDREAMS, under the guidance of Ayan Roy Mukherjee (Founder \n& CEO), I developed a secure and scalable E-commerce platform. Using Spring Boot and Hibernate, I built a modular, user- \nfriendly system with strong security and reliable performance. Comprehensive testing and modern development practices \nensured the platform was efficient, robust, and deployment-ready. \n \n• Programming Languages: Java (Core Java, OOP, Collections, Multithreading, File I/O), JavaScript. \n• Frameworks & Libraries: Spring Boot, React.js, Bootstrap. \n• Database: MySQL, SQL \n• Web Technologies: HTML5, CSS3 \n• Development Tools: IntelliJ IDEA, VS Code, Git, GitHub, Postman \n• Concepts: REST API Development, JWT Authentication, Object-Oriented Programming, Clean \nCode Architecture \n \n• Basics of Android App Development From Masai School in 2023. \n• Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 2025 Certified AI Foundation Associate. \n \nTrimNet, Technologies Used :- React , Spring boot , Java , PostgreSql \n• Built a full-stack URL shortening application (TrimNet) using React, Spring Boot, Java, and PostgreSQL. Designed \nRESTful APIs for link generation, redirection, and analytics with secure backend validation. Developed a responsive UI \nwith seamless frontend–backend integration and optimized database operations for high performance. Deployed the \napplication to cloud platforms ensuring reliability and smooth user access. \nResearch Assistant, Technologies Used :React, Spring Boot , Java , Gemiui API key , \n• UI and Spring Boot with Gemini API for intelligent text processing. Implemented features to summarize selected text, \ngenerate context-based questions, and suggest related topics in real time. Designed secure backend APIs for seamless \ncommunication with the extension and optimized response handling for faster output. Built a smooth, user-friendly interface \nto improve productivity and research efficiency.','{\"name\": \"Education\", \"email\": \"gautamrajanexpert@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"6205499691\", \"skills\": [], \"address\": \"MCA, Galgotia college of Engineering and technology 2024 – Present | Greater Noida, India\", \"contact\": \"gautamrajanexpert@gmail.com | 6205499691\", \"summary\": \"Key Skills Certificates Projects Gautam sharma Java Full Stack\", \"location\": \"MCA, Galgotia college of Engineering and technology 2024 – Present | Greater Noida, India\", \"projects\": [{\"name\": \"Gautam sharma Java Full Stack\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"gautamrajanexpert@gmail.com 6205499691 Noida sector 44\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"UP Indian\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"linkedin.com/in/gautam-sharma-ba79712ba https://github.com/GautamSharma16\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"Profile Summary\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"MCA student with strong Java development skills and hands-on experience in building full-stack applications. Demonstrated\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"expertise in object-oriented programming\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"data handling\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"and problem-solving through academic and personal projects. Passionate\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"about developing scalable\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"high-performance applications with clean code architecture and a strong attention to detail. Dedicated to\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"continuous learning and contributing effectively to modern software development environments.\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"MCA\", \"tech\": \"\", \"description\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"Galg