e in Sales and Marketing, Business Development, Client Relationship Management and Team Management. Expertise in handling all sales and marketing ,business development activities, analyzing market trends and establishing healthy and prolonged business relations with customers PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE Sales Manager-Intelliverse Telecom P Ltd,India Oct 2013- Till date Currently handling products and services include:IVR Solutions, Call Centre Solutions ,Video Conferencing Solutions\", \"location\": \"Sales Manager-Intelliverse Telecom P Ltd,India Oct 2013- Till date\", \"projects\": [], \"education\": [{\"year\": \"\", \"degree\": \"MBA (Marketing & Sales)\", \"stream\": \"\", \"institution\": \"\"}], \"languages\": [], \"experience\": [{\"role\": \"Sales Manager-Intelliverse Telecom P Ltd,India Oct 2013- Till date\", \"period\": \"\", \"points\": [\"Currently handling products and services include:IVR Solutions, Call Centre Solutions ,Video Conferencing Solutions\", \"Generating new logos, map & target new accounts by effective sales planning, forecasting & prospecting.\", \"Regular follow-ups and generating new business from new customers.\", \"Interacting with internal cross functional team like Pre-Sales, Revenue, Delivery, Service, and Collection\"], \"company\": \"\"}], \"achievements\": [], \"certificates\": [], \"social_links\": [], \"profile_image\": \"\", \"certifications\": []}',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-01 10:51:56','2026-06-01 10:51:56'),(17,NULL,'l7sWTV0XZXh9yHV4TGs3wLyUJtEangOJnh0ORRUD','Sales Manager',NULL,'Juble Resume.docx','Juble Varghese\n Phone: +91 9740990080 Email: kmjuble@gmail.com \n\nSales professional with over 8.4 years of experience in Sales and Marketing, Business Development, Client Relationship Management and Team Management. Expertise in handling all sales and marketing ,business development activities, analyzing market trends and establishing healthy and prolonged business relations with customers\n\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\nSales Manager-Intelliverse Telecom P Ltd,India Oct 2013- Till date\nCurrently handling products and services include:IVR Solutions, Call Centre Solutions ,Video Conferencing Solutions\nGenerating new logos, map & target new accounts by effective sales planning, forecasting & prospecting.\nRegular follow-ups and generating new business from new customers.\nInteracting with internal cross functional team like Pre-Sales, Revenue, Delivery, Service, and Collection\nExcellent problem solving skills\n\nArea Sales Manager– Reliance Communications Ltd, India Aug 2011 – Sep 2013\nCurrently handling Reliance Global Enterprise Business (Wired services). Products and services include:\n-Voice, Data, Internet Data Centre, International data, Internet Leased lines \nHandling existing set of accounts and responsible to retain revenue and increase the revenue share by up selling the services and avoid churn to competition\nDetermining business growth across the product lines & achieving targets for sales, revenue, collections & customer satisfaction.\nGenerating new logos, map & target new accounts by effective sales planning, forecasting & prospecting.\nLiaising with cross functional teams (BSG, Product team, Commercial, Delivery, Support and Service) to ensure the right solution given to the customer and SLA meets the interests of both the customer & company\nExcellent relationship with most of the corporate companies\nResponsibility of handling team members and make sure that new cases, leads and prospects are generating through cold calls, references and the network\nRegular follow-ups and generating new business from new and existing customers.\nWorking on high value deals from different verticals of the industry.\n\nSales Manager – Net4 India Limited India July2010 – July 2011\nManaged the entire spectrum of marketing activities for ensuring optimum product penetration. \nFurnishing additional revenue generating solutions and referrals through existing accounts.\nDriving the business in SME and SMB segment through selling of services like Internet Leased Line, VoIP, Server Collocation etc\nMaintaining an opportunity pipeline, producing a funnel report and closing the business deals, thereby meeting the targets.\nLead team activities, marketing, and business relationships.\n\nSr.Excecutive – Bharti Airtel Services Limited, India Sep 2007 – June 2010\nSuccessfully handled business development in domestic markets \nMaintaining an opportunity pipeline, producing a funnel report and closing the business deals, thereby meeting the targets.\nUp-selling and Cross selling Products and services to Existing and New Accounts\nService portfolio includes PRI, Internet Leased lines.\n\nSales Excecutive – Tata Teleservices Limited, India Sep 2005 – Aug 2007\nArising new business within existing like IBM, Accenture etc\nUp-selling and Cross selling products and services to Existing Accounts\nManaged various marketing activities to generate leads\n\nEDUCATION\nMBA (Marketing & Sales)\nBachelor of Commerce\nIT Skills: Conversant with Windows, MS Office & Internet Applications.\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\nDate of Birth: 10th Nov 1982\nLinguistic Abilities: English, Hindi, Malayalam, Kannada.\nSPIN certified, attended training in Leadership and Business Communication.\nReferences Available','{\"name\": \"Juble Varghese\", \"email\": \"kmjuble@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"+91 9740990080\", \"skills\": [], \"address\": \"Sales Manager-Intelliverse Telecom P Ltd,India Oct 2013- Till date\", \"contact\": \"kmjuble@gmail.com | +91 9740990080\", \"summary\": \"Sales professional with over 8.4 years of experience in Sales and Marketing, Business Development, Client Relationship Management and Team Management. Expertise in handling all sales and marketing ,business development activities, analyzing market trends and establishing healthy and prolonged business relations with customers PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE Sales Manager-Intelliverse Telecom P Ltd,India Oct 2013- Till date