 \"location\": \"\", \"projects\": [], \"education\": [], \"languages\": [], \"experience\": [], \"achievements\": [], \"certificates\": [], \"social_links\": [], \"profile_image\": \"\", \"certifications\": []}',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-01 12:18:45','2026-06-01 12:18:45'),(20,NULL,'l7sWTV0XZXh9yHV4TGs3wLyUJtEangOJnh0ORRUD','BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT',NULL,'Sandeep Mishra _Resume.docx','SANDEEP MISHRA\nBangalore, Karnataka Email:smimm1940@gmail.com / skmnt@hotmail.comPhone: (M) +91 7090536393\n\n~ BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT PROFESSIONAL ~\nTo be a part of a growing organization with a focused vision along with a strong and open-minded leadership, wherein I can utilize my skills and sharpen them further so as to become a better resource in the achievement of organizational goals and objectives\n\nSynopsis\n\nProactive, diligent and multi-skilled professional, contributing accomplished experience of 9+years in steering Business Development in the field of Fire Security Products & Telecommunication Services \nPresently working with Idea Cellular Ltd., Bangalore as Manager Enterprise Business\nExcel in devising and implementing strategies to ensure smooth business operations, attainment of top-line/ bottom-line, promotion of products and achievement of business goals\nExpertise in creating innovative approaches that drive profitable revenue growth \nA dynamic go getter with the desire to remain on a cutting edge, drive new business through key accounts and establish strategic partnership to increase revenue\nOutstanding success in building and maintaining relationships with key corporate decision makers, establishing large volumes, high profit accounts with excellent levels of retention and loyalty\nSkilled in managing teams to work in sync with corporate set parameters & motivating them for achieving business goals\nExceptionally well organized with a track record that demonstrates self motivation, creativity and initiatives to achieve both personal and corporate goals\nKey Accounts handled:Sun Edison, Zyme Solutions, Gerdau Steel, Cross domain, Biocon Ltd, Tesco Hindustan, Target Corporation Ltd, Subex Ltd, Informatica Business Solutions, Volvo India Pvt. Ltd., Apollo, Toyota Financial, CCD, Cross Domain, Curam software\nProjects handled on Telecom Industries (Tata Indicom, BSNL, Idea for IMM) and Marketing Research for Fan, done for IMM \n\nCompetency Matrix\n\nBusiness Development & Management\nSales & Marketing\nKey Account Management \nChannel Management\nCross Selling\nCustomer Relationship Management\nTerritory Management\nMarket Research\nClient Coordination\nStrategic Planning\nExecutive Leadership \nTeam Management& Training\n\nProfessional Background\n\nIDEA CELLULAR LTD., Bangalore (Feb’15 – Present)\nManager Sales\n\nKey Deliverables:\nResponsible for Sales and Market exploration & development for all the Voice, Data and Cloud based solutions\nAccountable for appointing new channel or DST and train them get the business from them\nInstrumental in managing existing accounts, cross selling, up selling retention hunting of new account\nEnsuring high quality services, resulting in customer delight and optimum resource utilization for maximum service quality\n\nTATA TELESERVICES LTD., Bangalore (Nov’13 – Jan’15)\nBusiness Relationship Manager\n\nKey Deliverables:\nEfficiently handled Top Corporate & Strategic accounts\nResponsible for sales, market exploration & development for all the Voice and Cloud based solutions\nManaged existing accounts by facilitating coordination between the company & customers\nEnsured high quality services, resulting in customer delight and optimum resource utilization for maximum service quality\nEnsured maximum customer satisfaction by closely interacting with potential clients & understand their requirements and customizing the service accordingly\n\nRELIANCE COMMINICATION, Bangalore (Jul’11 – Nov’13)\nArea Sales Manager\n\nKey Deliverables:\nManaged existing accounts by facilitating co-ordination between the company & customers\nEnsured high quality services, resulting in customer delight and optimum resource utilization\nInstrumental in managing existing accounts, cross selling, up selling retention hunting of new account\nEnsured maximum customer satisfaction by closely interacting with potential clients & understand their requirements and customizing the service accordingly\n\nCEASE FIRE INDUSTRIES LTD, Delhi (Jul’07 – Jun’11)\nSenior Territory Manager      \n\nKey Deliverables:\nResponsible for sales, market exploration & development for all the above defined services with the help of the team of Sales Executives\nEfficiently managed existing accounts by facilitating co-ordination between the company & customers\nEnsured high quality services, resulting in customer delight and optimum resource utilization for maximum service quality\nEnsured maximum customer satisfaction by closely interacting with potential clients & understand their requirements and customizing the service accordingly\n\nCredentials\n\nMBA (Marketing & Finance) from Institute of Marketing and Management in 2007\nB.Com. from University of Delhi in 2002\n\nTrainings Attended\nAttended trainings on C,C++,Java,Networking,OS,DS,DBMS Fox pro\n\nPersonal Profile\n \n\nLanguages Known:English & Hindi\nCurrent CTC 10.5L\nLocation Preference:Bangalore','{\"name\": \"SANDEEP MISHRA\", \"email\": \"smimm1940@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"+91 7090536393\", \"skills\": [], \"address\": \"Presently working with Idea Cellular Ltd., Bangalore as Manager Enterprise Business\", \"contact\": \"smimm1940@gmail.com | +91 7090536393\", \"summary\": \"~ BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT PROFESSIONAL ~ To be a part of a growing organization with a focused vision along with a strong and open-minded leadership, wherein I can utilize my skills and sharpen them further so as to become a better resource in the achievement of organizational goals and objectives Synopsis Proactive, diligent and multi-skilled professional, contribu