ngineer gautamrajanexpert@gmail.com | +91 6205499691 | Noida, UP, India linkedin.com/in/gautam-sharma-3671162ab | github.com/GautamSharma16 PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY Motivated MERN Stack Developer with hands-on EXPERIENCE building scalable, production-grade full-stack web applications using MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js. Proficient in REST API design, JWT-based authentication, and building responsive React dashboards. Adept at working in collaborative team environments with strong command of Git workflows and modern AI-assisted development tools. Passionate ABOUT writing clean, high-performance code and delivering measurable impact.\nTECHNICAL SKILLS Frontend: React.js, JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap Backend: Node.js, Express.js, Spring Boot, Java Databases: MongoDB, MySQL, PostgreSQL Tools & TECHNOLOGIES Git, GitHub, REST APIs, JWT Authentication, Postman, VS Code, IntelliJ IDEA AI & Modern Dev: Cursor, Claude, Codex, MCP Servers, AI-Assisted Development PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE MERN Stack Developer Intern Feb 2024 – Present Companyvista Inc | On-site | my.companyvista.com - Engineered full-stack features across the platform using MongoDB, Express.js, React.js, and Node.js, contributing to a live production application with real user traffic.\n- Architected and documented RESTful APIs powering core business workflows, reducing frontend-backend integration time and improving response consistency.\n- Developed interactive React.js dashboards with real-time data rendering, improving data accessibility and boosting user engagement across key modules.\n- Optimized MongoDB aggregation pipelines and Express.js middleware, achieving approximately 25–30% improvement in API response times and overall application throughput.\nPROJECTS TrimNet — URL Shortener - React.js - Spring Boot - PostgreSQL | trimnet.vercel.app/ - Designed and delivered a full-stack URL shortening system with RESTful APIs supporting link creation, intelligent redirection, and per-link usage analytics.\n- Built a responsive, user-friendly React.js frontend with seamless backend integration and robust server-side validation, ensuring reliable data handling at scale.\n- Optimized PostgreSQL queries for high-throughput read/write operations and deployed the application to cloud infrastructure for consistent availability.\nAI Research Browser Extension - React.js - Spring Boot - Gemini API | github.com/GautamSharma16/Research-Assistant - Developed a browser extension leveraging Google Gemini API to deliver real-time text summarization, context-aware question generation, and smart topic suggestions.\n- Engineered secure Spring Boot backend APIs handling AI request routing and response optimization, reducing processing latency for a smoother user EXPERIENCE\n.\n- Crafted an intuitive, productivity-focused UI that streamlined research workflows, enabling users to extract key insights from web content without switching tabs.\nEDUCATION Master of Computer Applications (MCA) 2024 – Present Galgotia College of Engineering and Technology, Greater Noida | CGPA: 7.70 Bachelor of Computer Applications (BCA) 2021 – 2024 Gopal Narayan Singh University, Sasaram | CGPA: 7.95 CERTIFICATIONS Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 2025 Certified AI Foundation Associate - Basics of Android App Development — Masai School (2023)','{\"link\": \"\", \"name\": \"GAUTAM\", \"email\": \"gautamrajanexpert@gmail.com\", \"github\": \"\", \"mobile\": \"+91 6205499691\", \"skills\": [\"Javascript\", \"React\", \"Node\", \"Express\", \"Java\", \"Spring\", \"Mysql\", \"Postgresql\", \"Mongodb\", \"Bootstrap\", \"Git\", \"Github\", \"Rest\", \"Api\"], \"address\": \"Noida, UP, India\", \"contact\": \"+91 6205499691\", \"summary\": \"- Architected and documented RESTful APIs powering core business workflows, reducing frontend-backend integration time and improving response consistency. - Developed interactive React.js dashboards with real-time data rendering, improving data accessibility and boost